WEBVTT

00:38:58.829 --> 00:39:01.996
and to accept difficult things. Right.

00:39:02.288 --> 00:39:06.871
If the journeys we take are just like
exactly how we imagined they'd be

00:39:06.871 --> 00:39:10.204
and plan they'd be and and everything
was idyllic and blissful.

00:39:10.204 --> 00:39:12.996
And there was no there was
no sort of difficulty.

00:39:13.246 --> 00:39:15.829
We would be like, yeah, that
that was that was fun.

00:39:15.829 --> 00:39:18.663
But, you know, there's there's
nothing about it. Right.

00:39:18.704 --> 00:39:22.329
There's no texture to it. Yeah. No, no.
Great.

00:39:22.621 --> 00:39:26.954
And I think that the the grittier an
experience is, the more it teaches us,

00:39:26.954 --> 00:39:29.954
we never, ever, ever forget the lessons
we learned the hard way.